Xx" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="temL2304 fdCmoCjM eHl_0FcG" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="929c2ecb-e8f9-44c2-88a0-f2faae218884"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">¡Valeee! 💗 Vamos ahora con </span><span class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">TODOS los pasos de la Persona 2</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">, igual de detallados que los de la Persona 1, desde crear su archivo en GitHub hasta dejar su parte terminada, con textos redactados, imágenes, tabla, diagrama Markdown extra, referencias y commits.</span></p><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">La Persona 2 se encargará de la parte final del proyecto </span><span class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Informática ambiental</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p><h1 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">PERSONA 2 — GUÍA COMPLETA</strong></span></h1><h2 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">1. ¿Qué apartados te corresponden?</strong></span></h2><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Tu parte se centra en cómo la tecnología puede perjudicar al medioambiente y qué podemos hacer para que sea más sostenible.</span></p><div class="JYjgF4u8" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><h2 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">👩‍💻 Persona 2</strong></span></h2><ul class="bYalj1om" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><ol class="bYalj1om" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" start="5" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); counter-reset: d-list-item 4; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div cla