 data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Si la Persona 1 ya ha creado su archivo, también aparecerá </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">contaminacion-y-residuos.md</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">No necesitas tocar el archivo de la Persona 1. Vas a trabajar en el tuyo de forma independiente.</span></p><h1 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">PASO 3. Crear el archivo de la Persona 2</strong></span></h1><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Ahora vamos a crear el archivo en GitHub.</span></p><ol class="bYalj1om" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Entra en el repositorio </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">informatica-ambiental</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stre