nk: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Súbela a GitHub dentro de la carpeta </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">imagenes</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Ponle el nombre:</span></p><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">green-it.jpg</span></code></p></div></div></li><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Confirma la subida mediante </span><span class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Commit changes</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><h3 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Cómo insertarla en el archivo</strong></span></h3><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Debajo del apartado de Green IT escribe:</span></p><div data-client-defined-widget="code_block"><div class="zu1QM337"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="light" class="relative iW7ipzd2 w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default UAMd1Axl light @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none gap-2 KWWActt8 min-h-12 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 RZfVQhuH"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="X4VkKCza" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-8dc6f1b8c26c63fd.svg#codex-icon-code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 truncate flex-1">Markdown</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover aria-pressed:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent [[data-control-group]_&amp;]:not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:active:bg-secondary-ghost-active h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Habilitar ajuste de línea" aria-pre