<span>|---|---|</span>
<span>| Apagar los equipos | Reduce el consumo eléctrico |</span>
<span>| Reparar los dispositivos | Evita generar nuevos residuos |</span>
<span>| Reutilizar ordenadores | Alarga su vida útil |</span>
<span>| Reciclar correctamente | Permite recuperar materiales |</span>
<span>| Comprar equipos eficientes | Reduce el consumo energético |</span>
<span>| Reducir las impresiones | Ahorra papel y recursos |</span></span></code></div></div></div></div><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">La tabla te quedará así cuando GitHub la muestre:</span></p><div class="goa0AOk5" data-d-column-sizing="auto" data-d-component="table"><div class="RIVuauLW" data-d-table-viewport="true"><table class="s3u64BFC" data-d-column-sizing="auto" data-d-dividers="" style="table-layout: auto;"><tbody><tr data-d-component="table-row"><th data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Medida</span></p></th><th data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Beneficio ambiental</span></p></th></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Apagar los equipos</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Reduce el consumo eléctrico</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Reparar los dispositivos</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Evita generar nuevos residuos</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Reutilizar ordenadores</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Alarga su vida útil</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Reciclar correctamente</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Permite recuperar materiales</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Comprar equipos eficientes</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Reduce el consumo energético</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Reducir las impresiones</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Ahorra papel y recursos</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="nCUHEits" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 887px; height: 258px;"></div></div><h1 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">PASO 9. Apartado 8 — Conclusión general del proyecto</strong></span></h1><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">La conclusión debe cerrar el trabajo entero, no solamente tu parte. Como tú eres la Persona 2, te encargas de redactarla después de que las dos hayáis terminado los contenidos.</span></p><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Puedes poner esta:</span></p><div data-client-defined-widget="writing_block" data-id="68424"><div class="group/writing-block-surface relative isolate w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip rounded-[var(--oai-wb-radius)] [box-shadow:var(--oai-wb-shadow)] [color:var(--oai-wb-text-primary)] [contain:inline-size] [font-family:var(--oai-wb-font-sans)] aD2tvAaq fA0_fZwT z-10 clear-both my-4 [--wb-surface-primary:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-surface-elevated-secondary)_86%,var(--color-surface))] [--wb-accent:var(--color-accent)] [--wb-interactive-background:var(--color-background-secondary-ghost-hover)] [--wb-on-accent:var(--color-text-on-accent)] [--wb-selection:var(--color-background-text-selection)] [--wb-font-size:var(--codex-chat-font-size,0.875rem)]" data-oai-writing-block-surface="" data-markdown-copy="rich-block" data-markdown-copy-text="## 8. Conclusión

A lo largo de este proyecto hemos aprendido que la informática, aunque es fundamental en nuestra vida diaria, también tiene un impacto sobre el medioambiente. La fabricación de dispositivos, el consumo de energía y la generación de residuos electrónicos son algunos de los problemas relacionados con el uso de la tecnología.

También hemos conocido la importancia de evitar la obsolescencia prematura y de apostar por una informática más ecológica. Reparar, reutilizar, reciclar y utilizar los dispositivos de forma responsable son acciones que pueden ayudar a reducir este impacto.

En nuestra opinión, no se trata de dejar de utilizar la tecnología, sino de aprender a utilizarla de una manera más consciente y sostenible. La informática puede seguir avanzando sin olvidar la importancia de proteger el medioambiente." data-testid="chatgpt-writing-block" data-writing-block-variant="document" style="--oai-wb-spacing: var(--spacing,0.25rem); --oai-wb-text-primary: var(--wb-text-primary,var(--color-token-text-primary,var(--text-primary,#0d0d0d))); --oai-wb-text-secondary: var(--wb-text-secondary,var(--color-token-text-secondary,var(--text-secondary,#5d5d5d))); --oai-wb-text-tertiary: var(--wb-text-tertiary,var(--color-token-text-tertiary,var(--text-tertiary,#8f8f8f))); --oai-wb-surface-primary: var(--wb-surface-primary,var(--color-token-main-surface-primary,var(--main-surface-primary,#fff))); --oai-wb-surface-secondary: var(--wb-surface-secondary,var(--color-token-bg-tertiary,var(--main-surface-secondary,#f5f5f5))); --oai-wb-interactive-secondary-hover: var(--wb-interactive-secondary-hover,var(--color-token-interactive-bg-secondary-hover,var(--oai-wb-surface-secondary))); --oai-wb-border: var(--wb-border,var(--color-token-border,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/8%)))); --oai-wb-border-hover: var(--wb-border-hover,var(--color-token-border-default,var(--border-medium,rgb(0 0 0/12%)))); --oai-wb-divider: var(--wb-divider,var(--color-token-border-light,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/5%)))); --oai-wb-focus: var(--wb-focus,var(--color-token-focus-border,var(--border-strong,#5b9dd9))); --oai-wb-control-border: var(--wb-control-border,var(--interactive-border-focus,var(--oai-wb-focus))); --oai-wb-entity-accent: var(--wb-entity-accent,var(--theme-entity-accent,var(--oai-wb-accent))); --oai-wb-accent: var(--wb-accent,var(--interactive-label-accent-default,#0285ff)); --oai-wb-on-accent: var(--wb-on-accent,var(--bg-primary,#fff)); --oai-wb-interactive-background: var(--wb-interactive-background,var(--interactive-bg-accent-default,color-mix(in srgb,#0285ff 12%,transpare