ix(in srgb,#0285ff 12%,transparent))); --oai-wb-selection: var(--wb-selection,var(--theme-user-selection-bg,var(--selection,#93c5fd))); --oai-wb-radius: var(--wb-radius,1.5rem); --oai-wb-radius-sm: var(--wb-radius-sm,0.5rem); --oai-wb-shadow: var(--wb-shadow,0 4px 80px rgb(0 0 0/2%)); --oai-wb-shadow-lg: var(--wb-shadow-lg,0 10px 30px rgb(0 0 0/12%)); --oai-wb-font-sans: var(--wb-font-sans,var(--font-sans,sans-serif)); --oai-wb-font-mono: var(--wb-font-mono,var(--font-mono,monospace)); --oai-wb-font-size: var(--wb-font-size,0.875rem); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-contrast: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-contrast,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary)); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-secondary: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-secondary,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary));"><div contenteditable="true" aria-label="Empieza a escribir" aria-multiline="true" role="textbox" translate="no" class="ProseMirror xaiQhStK leading-relaxed"><h2 dir="auto"><span>8. Conclusión</span></h2><p dir="auto"><span>A lo largo de este proyecto hemos aprendido que la informática, aunque es fundamental en nuestra vida diaria, también tiene un impacto sobre el medioambiente. La fabricación de dispositivos, el consumo de energía y la generación de residuos electrónicos son algunos de los problemas relacionados con el uso de la tecnología.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>También hemos conocido la importancia de evitar la obsolescencia prematura y de apostar por una informática más ecológica. Reparar, reutilizar, reciclar y utilizar los dispositivos de forma responsable son acciones que pueden ayudar a reducir este impacto.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span>En nuestra opinión, no se trata de dejar de utilizar la tecnología, sino de aprender a utilizarla de una manera más consciente y sostenible. La informática puede seguir avanzando sin olvidar la importancia de proteger el medioambiente.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] z-[2] [box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--oai-wb-border)] group-hover/writing-block-surface:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--oai-wb-border-hover)]"></div></div></div><div class="aIXBUsFA" data-d-component="divider" style="--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;"></div><h1 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">PASO 10. El punto extra de Markdown — Diagrama Mermaid</strong></span></h1><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Este apartado es el que te ayudará a cumplir el requisito de incorporar una característica de Markdown que no hayáis visto en clase.</span></p><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Mermaid permite crear diagramas a partir de texto y GitHub los representa automáticamente.</span></p><h3 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Cómo añadirlo</strong></span></h3><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">En tu archivo </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">sostenibilidad-informatica.md</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">, después del apartado de medidas sostenibles y antes de la conclusión, pega lo siguiente:</span></p><div data-client-defined-widget="code_block"><div class="zu1QM337"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="light" class="relative iW7ipzd2 w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default UAMd1Axl light @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none gap-2 KWWActt8 min-h-12 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 RZfVQhuH"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="X4VkKCza" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-8dc6f1b8c26c63fd.svg#codex-icon-code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 truncate flex-1">Markdown</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover aria-pressed:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent [[data-control-group]_&amp;]:not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:active:bg-secondary-ghost-active h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Habilitar ajuste de línea" aria-pressed="false" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="X4VkKCza" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-8dc6f1b8c26c63fd.svg#codex-icon-text-overflow-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover aria-pressed:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent [[data-control-group]_&amp;]:not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:active:bg-secondary-ghost-active h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Copiar código" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="X4VkKCza" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-8dc6f1b8c26c63fd.svg#codex-icon-square-on-square-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div data-code-block-source="true" class="text-size-chat overflow-auto outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-inset kILllFLk whitespace-pre px-4 pt-0 pb-3 md:px-5 chatgpt-code-scrollport EYx4bdtL" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! block text-size-code ybJ8Tl3I min-w-max"><span><span></span>
<span><span class="hljs-section">## 8. Diagrama: informática sostenible</span></span>
<span></span>
<span>El siguiente diagrama representa algunas acciones que podemos llevar a cabo para reducir el impacto ambiental de la informática.</span>
<span></span>
<span>```mermaid</span>
<span>flowchart TD</span>
<span>    A[Uso de dispositivos informáticos] --&gt; B[Impacto ambiental]</span>
<span>    B --&gt; C[Consumo energético]</span>
<span>    B --&gt; D[Residuos electrónicos]</span>
<span>    C --&gt; E[Ahorrar energía]</span>
<span>    C --&gt; F[Utilizar equipos eficientes]</span>
<span>    D --&gt; G[Reparar y reutilizar]</span>
<span>    D --&gt; H[Reciclar correctamente]</span>
<span>    E --&gt; I[Informática sostenible]</span>
<span>    F --&gt; I</span>
<span>    G --&gt; I</span>
<span>    H --&gt; I</span>
<span>```</span>
<span></span></span></code></div></div></div></div><div class="JYjgF4u8" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" data-d-flex-in-row="" style="flex: var(--w-box-flex-in-row, 0 0 auto); max-width: 768px; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="JYjgF4u8" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 768px;"><div><div class="onilkE9Z" data-d-component="grid" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2); grid-template-columns: repeat(1, minmax(0px, 1fr));"><div class="JYjgF4u8" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="BcA3fIZv yeaWuk8v ljDyDDAK group/search-image" data-d-component="image" data-d-stream-media="" data-d-frame="" data-d-hover-zoom="" style="border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;"><img alt="Working with non-code files - GitHub Docs" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="LDLXtMhb BcA3fIZv GUJwJttL" draggable="false" src="./imagen1_files/8xyxyuiBcaLhtNfujJxnIEquei85fotWmjQPEw-scXFyHDOCKhYN-ZTwUeYKYCy_NF-i7Sfz1wbnkbBBR8yunk3697wFuYK9PR-FA02T7R0pMlovp44ed3liPMpNGQhCfZLYZZfSGrClT10wOyhXhGTO60-YCd4eoOkk98P4734" style="border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; height: 100%; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 62% 50%;" data-loaded=""><div class="OjqK7X0k" data-d-image-loading=""><div class="JYjgF4u8 B3O2RR2x" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="loading-block" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: light-dark(var(--dil-image-loading-light-bg, var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-background-info-surface))), var(--theme-user-msg-b