er/generated-image-preview:pointer-events-auto group-hover/generated-image-preview:opacity-100 group-hover/search-image:pointer-events-auto group-hover/search-image:opacity-100" data-saved="false" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default bg-text/5 not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-text/10 data-[state=open]:bg-text/10 border-transparent px-2 py-0.5 text-sm leading-[18px] [[data-settings-panel]_&amp;]:button-toolbar [[data-settings-panel]_&amp;]:py-0 [[data-settings-panel]_&amp;]:text-sm [[data-settings-panel]_&amp;]:leading-[18px] group/gallery-action !bg-transparent !p-0 !text-media-foreground enabled:hover:!bg-transparent relative shrink-0 !border-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-loading-indicator]]:absolute [&amp;&gt;[data-loading-indicator]]:inset-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-loading-indicator]]:m-auto size-9 outline-hidden cursor-interaction" aria-label="Añadir a favoritos" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-pressed="false" id="radix-_r_1r9_" data-state="closed"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-none bg-transparent group-hover/gallery-action:bg-media-background/25 group-focus/gallery-action:bg-media-background/25"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-8dc6f1b8c26c63fd.svg#codex-icon-bookmark-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="UCrMGpxn"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><h3 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">¿Qué significa el diagrama?</strong></span></h3><ul class="bYalj1om" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">El uso de la tecnología genera un impacto ambiental.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Ese impacto puede estar relacionado con el consumo energético y los residuos.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Para reducirlo, podemos ahorrar energía, utilizar equipos eficientes, reparar, reutilizar y reciclar.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Todas estas medidas contribuyen a una informática más sostenible.</span></p></div></div></li></ul><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Importante:</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> GitHub interpreta los diagramas Mermaid si el código está dentro de un bloque </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">mermaid</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">. No necesitas descargar ningún programa para dibujarlo.</span></p><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Como ya hemos utilizado los números 5, 6, 7 y 8 en los apartados, al incorporar el diagrama podéis ajustar la numeración de la conclusión y referencias para que quede coherente. Por ejemplo, el diagrama podría ser el apartado 8 y la conclusión el 9.</span></p><h1 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">PASO 11. Añadir las referencias y fuentes</strong></span></h1><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Al final de tu archivo añade las fuentes que has utilizado para investigar. Las referencias deben ser enlaces reales, no simplemente nombres.</span></p><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Copia este apartado:</span></p><div data-client-defined-widget="writing_block" data-id="68425"><div class="group/writing-block-surface relative isolate w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip rounded-[var(--oai-wb-radius)] [box-shadow:var(--oai-wb-shadow)] [color:var(--oai-wb-text-primary)] [contain:inline-size] [font-family:var(--oai-wb-font-sans)] aD2tvAaq fA0_fZwT z-10 clear-both my-4 [--wb-surface-primary:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-surface-elevated-secondary)_86%,var(--color-surface))] [--wb-accent:var(--color-accent)] [--wb-interactive-background:var(--color-background-secondary-ghost-hover)] [--wb-on-accent:var(--color-text-on-accent)] [--wb-selection:var(--color-background-text-selection)] [--wb-font-size:var(--codex-chat-font-size,0.875rem)]" data-oai-writing-block-surface="" data-markdown-copy="rich-block" data-markdown-copy-text="## 10. Referencias y fuentes de información

- [Reglamento europeo sobre diseño ecológico de productos sostenibles](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/ES/ALL/?uri=CELEX:32024R1781) — Información sobre durabilidad, reparabilidad, eficiencia energética y diseño sostenible.
- [Directiva europea sobre reparación de bienes](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/ES/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32024L1799) — Medidas para promover la reparación de productos.
- [Directiva europea sobre prácticas comerciales desleales y transición ecológica](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/ES/ALL/?uri=CELEX:32024L0825) — Información relacionada con la obsolescencia temprana y la sostenibilidad.
- [Global E-waste Monitor](https://ewastemonitor.info/) — Información sobre residuos electrónicos y su impacto.

