class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">En </span><span class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Commit changes</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">, escribe:</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Desarrollados los apartados de sostenibilidad informática</span></code></p><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">8. Confirma el commit.</span></p><h3 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Subir tus imágenes</strong></span></h3><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Si todavía no has subido las dos imágenes:</span></p><ol class="bYalj1om" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Pulsa </span><span class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Add file → Upload files</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Sube </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">obsolescencia.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> y </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">green-it.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> a la carpeta </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">imagenes</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Comprueba que el nombre de la carpeta y de las imágenes coincide con el que has puesto en el Markdown.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="EWTmaRtl" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="DbD0Oj0b"><div class="qdSQ_4Rw" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Escribe como mensaje de commit:</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Añadidas imágenes de obsolescencia y Green IT</span></code></p><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">5. Confirma los cambios.</span></p><h3 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Cómo comprobar que las imágenes funcionan</strong></span></h3><p class="kDAqPLZc dOmvsSM7" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Abre el archivo </span><code class="LNMR8qbF" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">sostenibilidad-informatica.md</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> desde el repositorio, pero en modo normal de lectura, no de edición. Si las imágenes aparecen dentro del texto, está bien. Si ves un icono de imagen rota, revisa la ruta.</span></p><div class="aIXBUsFA" data-d-component="divider" style="--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;"></div><h1 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="xl" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">PASO 14. Checklist de la Persona 2</strong></span></h1><div class="JYjgF4u8" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><h2 class="kDAqPLZc ij922CZO" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="BHzYtQdb">Checklist — Persona 2</strong></span></h2><div data-has-label="" data-orientation="left" class="hHfb6xfS tuMRJ86X"><button type="button" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" data-state="unchecked" value="on" class="HGrYIk8n" id="_r_1rl_" data-d-component="checkbox"></button><label for="_r_1rl_" class="ormz6UZ3 zdjApaRA"><span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">He entrado en el repositorio informatica-ambiental</span></span></label></div><div data-has-label="" data-orientation="left" class="hHfb6xfS tuMRJ86X"><button type="button" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" data-state="unchecked" value="on" class="HGrYIk8n" id="_r_1rm_" data-d-component="checkbox"></button><label for="_r_1rm_" class="ormz6UZ3 zdjApaRA"><span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rg