extos, entenderlos y cambiar alguna expresión a vuestro estilo antes de entregarlo, para poder explicar al profesor qué habéis investigado y qué significa el diagrama. 💗</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none block h-0"></span><div class="nqqZbm7s mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0 min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent [[data-control-group]_&amp;]:not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:active:bg-secondary-ghost-active electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5 [contain-intrinsic-size:var(--icon-size,16px)] [@container_style(--actions-opacity:0)]:[content-visibility:hidden]" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7